isplay: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Cherry, Raspberry, Berry jam, Dark grape\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程摘录如下：\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1- 咖啡鲜果浮选，手选去除瑕疵\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2- 鲜果放在带孔的篮筐里氧化48小时\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3- 鲜果放入塑料袋或者发酵罐中厌氧发酵150小时\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          4- 鲜果浸入温度50摄氏度的热水中30分钟\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          5- 晒床干燥，夜间将咖啡果收入袋中过夜\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：辣椒波旁 Bourbon Aji\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒 Anaerobic Natural\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2024.12\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海运到港：2025.4\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：深色葡萄、葡萄干、精品黑巧、太妃糖苦甜尾韵\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Dark grape, Raisin, Single origin chocolate, Toffee-like sweet bitterness\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款辣椒波旁跟以往的都不太一样，以前的都是偏桃子草莓红色的莓果核果类，都是很轻盈的类型，这一款研磨后第一反应闻着发酵感很重，甚至有一些酱香（心里打鼓，完了，现在特别怕酱香）；破渣后赶紧喝了一口，还可以嘛，没有想象中那么重的发酵感，心安了很多；然后温度降一点点后逐渐解开了它的面纱，深色的莓果，果干，有很长一段温区里特别的像也门的炼金术士的那种精品黑巧的气味，然后尾韵的苦甜特别像太妃糖，也是温度越低越好喝～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程：还在等产区确认信息，确认后再更新发布。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：乌什乌什 Wushwush\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          式：厌氧水洗后热冲击\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n          Thermo-Shock after Anaerobic Washed\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2024.12\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海运到港：2025.4\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：很像一些瑰夏（非常好喝）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n     