          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程摘录如下：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1- 咖啡鲜果采收后\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          放在带孔的篮筐里有氧呼吸（氧化）12\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          小时\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2- 浮选，人工分拣\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3- 脱皮，在发酵罐中发有氧呼吸（氧化）12小时\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          4- 42小时厌氧发酵，发酵结束后热冲击\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          5- 干燥10-12天后收入谷物袋中静置15天\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Zarza\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          Zarza Coffee是由Gasca家族，一个已经3代的咖农家族企业所创立，农场一直以来跟其它咖农一样都是生产大宗的商业咖啡的，直到2012年，第三代接班人Jhonatan参加了SENA开设的一个咖啡培训，第一次接触到有别于传统的加工处理经验以外的处理方式，培训结束后，Jhonatan即刻与父母和叔叔和兄弟们商议，要转变咖啡的生产方式和产品定位，就这样开启了Zarza咖啡的精品之路；（SENA全称是\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          SERVICIO NACIONAL DE APRENDIZAJE，是哥伦比亚政府劳务部下属的一个公共培训服务机构，提供各类技术和补充课程培训，哥伦比亚很多咖农在SENA开设的各类咖啡专业课程里参与受益，而且它是免费的；我们在售的景秀农场的负责人Edwin就是SENA的讲师，也是CQI认证的Q的处理课讲师）。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SJPNRODxmJibvlLlianjpFbLFwzC2wO9TXricQ1NQLvIfwHMQdAkibXQMdZ1icvaPbqYSOd5e2fmHEbHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Zarza的意思是黑莓，当大家一致同意Jhonatan的想法后，需要一个新的名字/品牌来代表大家伙，这个时候Jhonatan的妻子提了一个主意，家族姓氏“Gasca”与黑莓灌木有关，而黑莓灌木的生长习性是它的周边会伴生着其它作物一起生长的，这就好像家族里所有成员的力量团结在一起，大家齐心协力去把咖啡的种植，管理和加工处理，生意都经营好，于是就这样定在了Zarza这个名字。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SJPNRODxmJibvlLlianjpFbLKicgsibBjKibwwvWdzBgYSRUdd5KV287t3ubzW1xLReXdib7gXNib9sE5FA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Zarza Coffee由位于海拔1450米至1800米不同海拔高度的4个家庭农场（LA MARIA、BELLA VISTA、LA PERLA 和 SANTA ANA）组成，其中有帕卡马拉、辣椒波旁、粉波旁、希爪波旁和Wush Wush等品种。农场不断发展壮大，家族也在不断壮大，成为一个欣欣向荣、生机勃勃的地方。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
